%SIXMD 1
# @?BENCH - TIME A FIXED INTEGER ADD LOOP

## DESCRIPTION

RUNS COUNT INTEGER ADD ITERATIONS AND PRINTS COUNT AND ELAPSED APPROXIMATE 60-HZ TICKS.

USAGE IS 'BENCH [COUNT]'.

THIS COMMAND IS IMPLEMENTED ENTIRELY IN PDP-6 ASSEMBLER AND IS PART OF THE
OPTIONAL ASMUTILS PACKAGE. IT IS INSTALLED IN /OPTION/BASE/EXEC.

## @?FILES

### @?/OPTION/BASE/EXEC/BENCH
OPTIONAL EXECUTABLE.

### @?/OPTION/BASE/SOURCE/ASMUTILS/BENCH.S
ASSEMBLER SOURCE.

